  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are morphs of the Agrippan canon (Celtic primary, from family_celtic theonym_set; Germanic variant, from family_germanic reflexes), never real Celtic/Germanic gods. Gundic is Neutral alone: both power-sets are ambivalent - somewhat honored, somewhat feared - and largely set aside for the Tuath-de (god-kin), the Anses (deified ancestors) and the spirits of grove and place. The drui keep the nemed-grove; the Gund- house keep an alhs-grove for their forebears.",
