      "9": "Ollam (supreme sage)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the wild Chaotic powers, feared and warded rather than worshipped, keep their morphs + an epithet: Maraxus -> Maragan the War-Fire (Gmc Marahs); Vacidus -> Faicid the Unmaker; Lusanto -> Losand the Hoard-Worm.",
